    "body": "test-only on issue/1362-delete-setup-undo-order · PR #1364 · pinned by setup_delete_order::undoing_delete_of_a_middle_setup_restores_its_place_and_the_program, setup_delete_order::undoing_delete_of_the_first_setup_puts_it_back_first · merges when reviewed. Finding: the setup order is the name order (setup::setups sorts by name); nothing stores a position, so undo already restores the setup's place. The tests pin that, including the full posted G-code text. The #1361 test's Front/Back pair was already [Back, Front] before the delete.",
